        "body": "CrowdStrike is a publicly traded global cybersecurity company (NASDAQ: CRWD, CIK 0001535527) that describes itself as a leader in stopping breaches through an AI-native approach. Its core offering is the CrowdStrike Falcon Platform, a cloud-native system designed to protect endpoints, cloud workloads, identities, and data. The company positions the platform as addressing what it calls three critical fronts of the AI era, including defending against AI-powered vulnerability exploitation, securing cloud environments through both agent and agentless protection, and providing AI model scanning alongside an AI security dashboard.\n\nCrowdStrike's tracked AI product is Charlotte AI, categorized under Security and Identity AI. The company describes it as focused on security operations, threat detection, autonomous response, and high-privilege access management. Charlotte AI sits within the broader Falcon Platform and reflects CrowdStrike's stated emphasis on using AI to respond to adversaries who, in the company's framing, weaponize AI to attack at speed.",
